[I] Routines for manipulating stashes

[T] Package::Stash provides an interface to manipulate Perl package symbol
[T] tables (stashes), adding, getting and removing package variables and
[T] subroutines, with XS and pure Perl backends.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Package-Stash

